WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.960
- I love that you write a book

00:00:00.960 --> 00:00:03.240
and you get to like, go all
over New Zealand, right?

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:04.073
Like for this book?

00:00:04.073 --> 00:00:04.906
- Yeah, right, yeah.

00:00:04.906 --> 00:00:08.190
I went to New Zealand,
traveled all over the islands

00:00:08.190 --> 00:00:10.766
and it's kinda like Peter
Pan's world honestly.

00:00:10.766 --> 00:00:13.020
It's got alpine, it's got glaciers,

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:17.010
it's got amazing
mountains, fjords, jungle,

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:19.020
flightless birds, great white sharks.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:20.490
There's so much to do there.

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:21.690
It really is an incredible place.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:22.530
- It's beautiful.

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:23.797
I remember the first time
I went there, I was like,

00:00:23.797 --> 00:00:25.230
"Why do I not live here?"

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:26.063
- [Guest] Right?
- Yeah.

00:00:26.063 --> 00:00:27.240
- Parts of it remind me of Scotland.

00:00:27.240 --> 00:00:28.410
It's got a real Scottish connection.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.670
That's kind of the reason I went there.

00:00:29.670 --> 00:00:31.710
But it is mountainous.

00:00:31.710 --> 00:00:33.780
It's an epic, epic country.

00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.280
- And you are the person that goes to,

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:36.360
I'm the person that goes to a place

00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:37.560
and like enjoys the scenery.

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:39.900
And you're a person that
adventures around, right?

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:41.760
You do all the things that might kill you.

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:42.593
- Yeah.
- Yeah, yeah

00:00:42.593 --> 00:00:44.880
- Yeah, yeah, I dived
with great white sharks.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.050
I jumped off cliffs.

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:48.135
They have, obviously, they
invented bungee jumping

00:00:48.135 --> 00:00:49.136
in New Zealand.

00:00:49.136 --> 00:00:49.969
- They did?

00:00:49.969 --> 00:00:50.802
I didn't know that.

00:00:50.802 --> 00:00:51.635
- They invented zorbing, if
you don't know what that is.

00:00:51.635 --> 00:00:52.530
- What's a, what?

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:54.840
- It's a big ball that you climb inside

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.463
and then rolled down a hill.

00:00:57.540 --> 00:00:58.620
It sounds terrible.

00:00:58.620 --> 00:00:59.453
It was great fun.

00:00:59.453 --> 00:01:01.530
- It sounds like the worst ride at a fair

00:01:01.530 --> 00:01:02.464
is what it sounds like.

00:01:02.464 --> 00:01:03.297
- Yeah, it's pretty much

00:01:03.297 --> 00:01:05.610
you then can fill the ball
with water or gin maybe,

00:01:05.610 --> 00:01:06.900
or Whatever you want, you can

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:08.520
- Now you've reeled me in, okay.

00:01:08.520 --> 00:01:09.353
All right.

00:01:09.353 --> 00:01:11.430
Well, I heard that the
forward is Peter Jackson.

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:12.510
That's amazing, "Lord of the Rings."

00:01:12.510 --> 00:01:13.890
So, did you meet while you were there?

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:14.850
- Sure, Peter Jackson.

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:16.920
No, we didn't meet him, unfortunately.

00:01:16.920 --> 00:01:18.300
But, you know, my co-star Graham,

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:20.640
he had worked on "The
Hobbit" many years ago.

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:23.340
I was possibly named after a Hobbit.

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:26.070
My brother was named
after an elf in real life.

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:28.560
So I was like, "This is meant to be."

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:31.510
So we went to Weta where they
build all of the animatronics

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:33.660
and the aesthetics

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:36.780
and they actually made
me up to be a creature

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:38.520
from "Lord of the Rings" and "The Hobbit."

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:40.890
Unfortunately, it wasn't
an elf, it was a dwarf.

00:01:40.890 --> 00:01:43.590
I got to play Growing the dwarf.

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:44.423
- Okay.

00:01:44.423 --> 00:01:46.320
- And it was quite a transformation.

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:47.580
- I know, wait, I wanna see the picture.

00:01:47.580 --> 00:01:49.470
'Cause it is quite the transformation.

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:50.303
- [Guest] There he is.

00:01:50.303 --> 00:01:51.136
- Yes.

00:01:51.136 --> 00:01:53.949
That guy is not picking up
a lot of women in New York.

00:01:53.949 --> 00:01:54.882
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:54.882 --> 00:01:55.813
- [Guest] Oh, I dunno.

00:01:55.813 --> 00:01:56.973
- I mean, well maybe a particular kind.

00:01:56.973 --> 00:01:57.806
- [Guest] Yeah.

